# Pre-v10.133, the registry was missing 65 of the 264 — including the
# entire Strategy Module (#141-155), Product Module (#131-140),
# Resource Optimization (#156-165), CIMS (#166-180), Compliance
# (#191-200), and Analytics Hub Extension (#286-290). v10.133 Phase 0
# Registry Hygiene declared all 65 as status='planned' and added this
# gate to prevent future drift.
#
# Implementation status (active vs planned) is tracked separately;
# G144 only verifies REGISTRATION coverage. Per-cluster implementation
# completeness is verified by the closure gates (G127 treasury, G129
# risk, G133 revenue assurance, etc.) and will be ratcheted as
# Phase 1-5 implementation drops complete each cluster.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

