            f"stretching/unrealistic). Returns ScenarioResult + Comparison"
            f"Report dataclasses with AllocationRow per recipient (amount, "
            f"pct_of_total, historical_achievement_pct, likelihood_label, "
            f"likelihood_score). PURE COMPUTATION — does not write to "
            f"target_cascade.json; manager separately commits via "
            f"Set-team-targets tab. New tab '🧪 What-if simulator' added "
            f"to cascade page between Strategic impact and Cascade tree "
            f"(is_mgr gated). UI: KPI+period selectors, current allocation "
            f"with coverage %, 4 preset split buttons (Equal / Weight by "
            f"history / Reset / Zero), per-row alternative number_input "
