            f"max_failure_rate + custom_check; DrillResult); library.py "
            f"(12 prebuilt Kenya-realistic drills: channel_survival 4 "
            f"(safaricom morning outage, swift correspondent failure, "
            f"kepss takes rtgs+kic together, full digital blackout); "
            f"macro_observation 3 (KES devaluation 5%, CBK emergency "
            f"hike 200bps, credit shock NPL +300bps); eom_pressure 2 "
            f"(ATM dispenser strain, M-Pesa callback blackhole); "
            f"chaos_ml 2 (train under partial outage, train with macro "
