    ("G228", gate_cost_matrix_admin),                                     # v10.339 — Cost matrix admin UI + runtime (B-030 closed): NEW data/cost_allocation_rules.json (10 seed rules covering 7.9B annual Tier-2 Kenya bank opex). EXTENDED utils/cost_allocation.py with CRUD (load_rules / save_rules / upsert_rule / delete_rule) + compute engine (apply_rules / reconciliation_report) that walks GL cost items and applies each rule's allocation_method (direct / driver_based / equal_split / activity_based_costing) using the configured drivers (staff_count_by_segment / loan_portfolio_value / deposit_balance) with weights. NEW admin UI in pages/7_admin.py — Performance section expanded to 3 tabs (KPI Library + Segment Configuration + Cost Matrix); Cost Matrix tab has 4 sub-tabs (Rules / Edit / Add / Allocation preview). Direct costs (loan loss provisions, funding interest expense) flagged separately for per-customer attribution rather than matrix allocation.
