    ("G230", gate_data_schema_lock),                                      # v10.342 — Data schema lock (Option D harmonization arc): NEW data/_schemas/ directory with 5 JSON Schema definitions (bank_targets, cost_allocation_rules, execute_initiatives, segment_config, strategic_initiatives). NEW utils/schema_validator.py — pure-stdlib JSON Schema validator subset (type, required, properties, additionalProperties, items, enum, pattern, oneOf, minItems, maxItems, minLength, minimum, maximum). validate_all_protected() runs every batch; 0 invalid files required. Surfaced a real producer/consumer divergence in strategic_initiatives: pages/83_strategy.py writes Title-case rag_status + int counts for linked_projects/key_milestones/stakeholders; utils/command_centre_strategic_initiatives.py expects UPPERCASE + different field names (initiative_id, phase, owner_role). Schema locked to canonical producer; divergence flagged in schema metadata for Option E resolution. validate_before_save() exposed for producers to fail-closed at write time. v10.343 — Schema lock extension (Option D sub-batch 2): 3 more files locked (kpi_library, org_hierarchy_config, pipeline) — G230 threshold strengthened from ≥5 to ≥8 schemas. Surfaced two more drift instances corrected against canonical producers: pipeline.probability range; kpi_library.direction values flagged for Option E consolidation.
